{"hierarchy":{"paths":[["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule"]]},"variants":[{"paths":["\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot"],"traits":[{"interfaceLanguage":"swift"}]}],"topicSections":[{"title":"Initializers","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/init(from:)"],"anchor":"Initializers","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Properties","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/count"],"anchor":"Instance-Properties","generated":true},{"title":"Instance Methods","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/encode(to:)"],"anchor":"Instance-Methods","generated":true},{"title":"Default Implementations","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/Equatable-Implementations"],"anchor":"Default-Implementations","generated":true}],"sections":[],"relationshipsSections":[{"title":"Conforms To","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8CopyableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/Se","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SE","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/SQ","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s8SendableP","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP"],"type":"conformsTo","kind":"relationships"}],"kind":"symbol","identifier":{"interfaceLanguage":"swift","url":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot"},"metadata":{"title":"WorldSnapshot","modules":[{"name":"WorldModule"}],"roleHeading":"Structure","navigatorTitle":[{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"role":"symbol","fragments":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"}],"externalID":"s:11WorldModule0A8SnapshotV","symbolKind":"struct","remoteSource":{"fileName":"Snapshot.swift","url":"https:\/\/github.com\/Tyler-Keith-Thompson\/ECS\/blob\/main\/Sources\/WorldModule\/Snapshot.swift#L33"}},"abstract":[{"text":"A saved copy of a world’s entities, hierarchy and the components of the listed types.","type":"text"}],"schemaVersion":{"patch":0,"minor":3,"major":0},"seeAlsoSections":[{"title":"Saving and Loading Worlds","identifiers":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistry","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/TypeRegistryError","doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/MapEntities"],"anchor":"Saving-and-Loading-Worlds","generated":true}],"primaryContentSections":[{"declarations":[{"platforms":["Linux"],"languages":["swift"],"tokens":[{"text":"struct","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"WorldSnapshot","kind":"identifier"},{"text":"<each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"genericParameter"},{"text":"> ","kind":"text"},{"text":"where","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:Se","text":"Decodable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:SE","text":"Encodable","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":", repeat each ","kind":"text"},{"text":"C","kind":"typeIdentifier"},{"text":" : ","kind":"text"},{"preciseIdentifier":"s:11WorldModule9ComponentP","text":"Component","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Component","kind":"typeIdentifier"}]}],"kind":"declarations"},{"mentions":["doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/SavingAndLoadingWorlds"],"kind":"mentions"},{"kind":"content","content":[{"anchor":"overview","type":"heading","text":"Overview","level":2},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Use a snapshot to save a world and restore it later, or to compare two worlds. A snapshot","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"is ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":", so you can encode it with any encoder, such as ","type":"text"},{"code":"JSONEncoder","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Take one with","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"isActive":true,"type":"reference","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/World\/snapshot(_:)"},{"text":", listing the component types to save, and rebuild a world from it","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"with ","type":"text"},{"code":"World(restoring:)","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":". Each component type you save must conform to ","type":"text"},{"code":"Codable","type":"codeVoice"},{"text":".","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"The following example saves a world as JSON and restores it:","type":"text"}]},{"type":"codeListing","code":["import Foundation","","var world = World()","let ship = world.spawn(Position(x: 1, y: 2), Health(current: 3))","let data = try JSONEncoder().encode(world.snapshot(Position.self, Health.self))","","let decoded = try JSONDecoder().decode(WorldSnapshot<Position, Health>.self, from: data)","let restored = World(restoring: decoded)","print(restored[Position.self, of: ship])","\/\/ Prints \"Position(x: 1.0, y: 2.0)\""],"syntax":"swift"},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"text":"Every entity handle, live or stale, means the same in the restored world as in the original,","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"so handles you saved elsewhere stay valid. The restored world also hands out the same handles","type":"text"},{"text":" ","type":"text"},{"text":"from later spawns.","type":"text"}]},{"type":"paragraph","inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"A snapshot holds no resources, hooks or change ticks, and the restored world’s components"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"are all added at its first tick. To save resources too, or to save a world without listing"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"its types at each call, use a "},{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/Scene","isActive":true,"type":"reference"},{"type":"text","text":"."}]},{"type":"aside","style":"note","name":"Note","content":[{"inlineContent":[{"type":"text","text":"Decoding throws "},{"type":"codeVoice","code":"DecodingError.dataCorrupted"},{"type":"text","text":" for data that no world could have"},{"type":"text","text":" "},{"type":"text","text":"produced, such as a component of an entity that isn’t live."}],"type":"paragraph"}]}]}],"references":{"doc://WorldModule/s9EscapableP":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s9EscapableP","title":"Swift.Escapable","type":"unresolvable"},"doc://WorldModule/s16SendableMetatypeP":{"type":"unresolvable","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/s16SendableMetatypeP","title":"Swift.SendableMetatype"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/WorldSnapshot/encode(to:)":{"title":"encode(to:)","role":"symbol","identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/encode(to:)","abstract":[{"type":"text","text":"Encodes the snapshot into the given encoder."}],"fragments":[{"kind":"keyword","text":"func"},{"kind":"text","text":" "},{"kind":"identifier","text":"encode"},{"kind":"text","text":"("},{"kind":"externalParam","text":"to"},{"kind":"text","text":": any "},{"kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:s7EncoderP","text":"Encoder"},{"kind":"text","text":") "},{"kind":"keyword","text":"throws"}],"type":"topic","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot\/encode(to:)","kind":"symbol"},"doc://WorldModule/documentation/WorldModule/WorldSnapshot/count":{"identifier":"doc:\/\/WorldModule\/documentation\/WorldModule\/WorldSnapshot\/count","role":"symbol","kind":"symbol","url":"\/documentation\/worldmodule\/worldsnapshot\/count","title":"count","type":"topic","fragments":[{"text":"var","kind":"keyword"},{"text":" ","kind":"text"},{"text":"count","kind":"identifier"},{"text":": ","kind":"text"},{"text":"Int","kind":"typeIdentifier","preciseIdentifier":"s:Si"}],"abstract":[{"type":"text",